/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (During training, it randomly "drops out" \(i.e., deactivates or ignores\) a fraction of the neurons in a layer for each training step.  This prevents "co-adaptation," where neurons become overly reliant on each other. You can think of it as training many different, smaller neural networks at the same time. )
